## 2. 既存ユーザーの削除（ad-hoc）

$ ansible -i hosts.yml oci-portfolio -m mysql_user -a "name=arumono_recipe_user state=absent login_unix_socket=/var/run/mysqld/mysqld.sock" --become
User deleted (arumono_recipe_user)

$ ansible -i hosts.yml oci-portfolio -m mysql_user -a "name=kakeibo_user state=absent login_unix_socket=/var/run/mysqld/mysqld.sock" --become
User deleted (kakeibo_user)

$ ansible -i hosts.yml oci-portfolio -m mysql_user -a "name=portfolio_user state=absent login_unix_socket=/var/run/mysqld/mysqld.sock" --become
User deleted (portfolio_user)

